    },
    {
      "id": "note-overview",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": -460,
        "y": 0
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "Run Train-And-Export first: this graph loads the iris-classifier.safetensors it writes. Without that file, ModelLoader stops with \"Weights file not found:\" and the full path it looked in. GraphInput and GraphOutput make the graph a function: Run on the canvas uses the default measurements and answers versicolor (setosa 0.001, versicolor 0.957, virginica 0.043). Save the graph, and POST /api/graph/run/<saved name> with {\"inputs\": {\"measurements\": [5.1, 3.5, 1.4, 0.2]}} returns species and probabilities as JSON.\n\n先執行 Train-And-Export：這張圖載入它寫出的 iris-classifier.safetensors。沒有那個檔案時，ModelLoader 會停下並顯示 \"Weights file not found:\" 與它找的完整路徑。GraphInput 與 GraphOutput 讓這張圖成為函式：在畫布上執行會用預設的測量值，回答 versicolor（setosa 0.001, versicolor 0.957, virginica 0.043）。存檔之後，對 POST /api/graph/run/<存檔名稱> 送出 {\"inputs\": {\"measurements\": [5.1, 3.5, 1.4, 0.2]}}，就會以 JSON 回傳 species 與 probabilities。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "start",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": -460,
          "y": 0
        },
        "noteWidth": 400
      }
    },
