        "noteContent": "That endpoint always runs the latest save. For a stable version behind an API key, publish the graph (docs: Publish, graphs as apps).\n\n那個端點永遠執行最新的存檔。要有固定版本並以 API key 保護，就發佈這張圖（文件：Publish，把圖發佈成 app）。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
